# Judge4-6-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:アリサちゃんが<br>感電死したと思ったのは、<br>何も電気椅子に<br>座ってたからだけじゃないわ。|#0104Trial06_Margo001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……ねえ、メルルちゃん。<br>あなたなら、<br>アリサちゃんの死体を見て<br>何が死因だと思うかしら？|#0104Trial06_Margo002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal1,ArmR1_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Pensive_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そ、そうですね……。<br>詳しいことは<br>専門家でもないので<br>わかりませんけど……。|#0104Trial06_Meruru001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal1,ArmR5_1,ArmL4,Eyes1_Normal_Open2,Mouth1_Angry_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:外傷がないので……<br>体の中身の問題だとは<br>思います。<br>病死や窒息、<br>溺死や毒殺……。|#0104Trial06_Meruru002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR7,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……そう、<br>つまりアリサちゃんは、<br>ある意味【病死】のようなもの<br>だったんじゃないかしら？|#0104Trial06_Margo003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR7,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:強い電気ショックは<br>止まった心臓を<br>動かす事もあるけれど……<br>逆に止めることだってあるわ。|#0104Trial06_Margo004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal1,ArmR1_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Pensive_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……電気椅子は<br>長時間高圧電流を流して<br>処刑する器具です……。|#0104Trial06_Meruru003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal2,ArmR1_2,ArmL3,Eyes2_Normal_Open1,Mouth2_Angry_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:なので<br>ちゃんと処刑された場合は<br>もっと黒焦げの死体に<br>なっていそうですが……。|#0104Trial06_Meruru004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal1,ArmR1_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Pensive_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……でも、短時間電流を<br>流されただけであれば、<br>外見上の変化がほとんどなく<br>死んでしまう事も<br>あるかもしれません……。|#0104Trial06_Meruru005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR7,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:【ショック死】という<br>言い方のほうが<br>わかりやすいかも<br>しれないわね。|#0104Trial06_Margo005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR6,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……どう？<br>エマちゃん。|#0104Trial06_Margo006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"現場に他の<link=\"Objection_01_04_06_01\">凶器</link>が<br>存在しない以上、<br>アリサちゃんは<br>電気椅子によって<br><link=\"Objection_01_04_06_02\">感電死</link>したと<br>考えるのが自然……。|#0104Trial06_Margo007|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR1,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……そう思わないかしら。|#0104Trial06_Margo008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4


